      "stage": "laddering",
      "text": "Would a simpler alternative address the core need? For example: (a) a read-only dashboard showing live worker activity across the pool, (b) a way to tag jobs as a 'batch' for later filtering/reporting, or (c) a `vibey wait --jobs j1,j2,j3` that just blocks until those specific jobs complete?"
